Package: dux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: dux maintainers <root@localhost>
Recommends: curl, bsdutils | util-linux
Suggests: smartmontools
Description: disk-full alerts, folder attribution and safe cleanup
 dux watches free space and inodes on every disk every 2 seconds and sends
 alerts (system log, wall, ntfy, Slack, webhook, email). A fast walker
 builds an in-memory folder tree hourly and after growth, so alerts say
 which folder grew, which service is writing and the safe fix. Includes
 `dux doctor`, `dux where`, levelled `dux cleanup` with preview, and health
 probes for filesystem errors, RAID, latency, pressure and SMART.
